// The mirror control: FLOAT values, a HALF output.  The reference keeps the
// arithmetic at prec=0 and only the move into the colour is half (codex's
// 15-shape precision matrix).  A change that makes half OUTPUTS imply half
// ARITHMETIC turns this row red.
half4 main(float4 p : TEXCOORD0) : COLOR
{
	float4 a = p * 1.003;
	return (half4)a;
}
